From 2aa22bcfda3c6b204b67ecb0ae09260927c836b9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: JoshuaHayesWasHere <josh.hayes121@icloud.com>
Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 01:12:38 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] fix(cursor): a Cursor instance's agent runs its commands in
 the instance environment's SHELL

@cursor/sdk runs in the server process and takes its shell from process.env.SHELL,
so a Cursor thread ran the server's login shell whatever its instance set. The runner
now makes each SDK call under an async scope where process.env.SHELL reads the
instance's SHELL, and leaves that scope for callbacks into T3, so T3's terminals and
other providers keep the server's shell. An instance with no SHELL is unchanged.
